e boycott back in i think 80s  or 70s so wimbledon will stay  wimbledon will have a fantastic  you know tournament they will have  amazing crowds and there will be a  champion for the likes of djokovic and  rafa nadal adding to their grand slam  titles is what's important here not the  points even so as wimbledon prepared to  celebrate 100 years of centre court they  couldn't have imagined it'd be in such  controversial circumstances  jackie baltrow sky news wimbledon
 

